-- The same enemies as 029-ordered-steps, damage 12 7 30 9. Register the reducer once and every spelling follows: the fold answers 30 twice, the scan shows the carry arriving there — 12 12 30 30.
-- The two fold spellings emit the same reduction. The scan is the running peak under the registered dyad.
--! registry ../registries/040-reducer-spellings.reg

--! out 30
threat/ Damage @ Enemies

--! out 30
fold(threat) Damage @ Enemies

--! out 12 12 30 30
threat\ Damage @ Enemies
